{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Introduction]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve taken over a tranquil bookstore for a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corner, a girl appears at the same time each day\u2014reading softly, her presence both quiet and captivating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between pages and passing days, you begin to close the distance between you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple shopkeeper and a customer\u2026 or something deeper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer lies in your choices\u2014and in how far your heart will take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Features]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two romance routes with 6 beautifully illustrated CG scenes, all fully voiced and animated with Live2D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/71359ac87d6aa3866e4a25f929e2e829.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/71359ac87d6aa3866e4a25f929e2e829.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive events change animations and voice reactions based on your choices and relationship status.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/cacefdecc2bd6f7136b3504114a7ae6b.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/cacefdecc2bd6f7136b3504114a7ae6b.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-hand mouse wheel control \u2014 interact with Fuyuno through a variety of gestures and actions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/9b95cd306936321126849ff1ae396ea5.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/9b95cd306936321126849ff1ae396ea5.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the size and position of interactive windows \u2014 zoom in or focus on any scene the way you prefer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/54d3226a621ffbe34d3d93e1949cc163.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/54d3226a621ffbe34d3d93e1949cc163.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the gaming to earn money, unlock new toys and coffee ingredients, and surprise Fuyuno with thoughtful little gifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/d359ee14b237922c6485a88b983e0908.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/d359ee14b237922c6485a88b983e0908.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different coffee ingredients to craft drinks with special effects, and watch Fuyuno\u2019s unexpected reactions unfold.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras/cc4ddb632f72dbc2075fe04cf7db37a1.avif?t=1768812209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/extras_big/cc4ddb632f72dbc2075fe04cf7db37a1.avif?t=1768812209 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Game Info]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced by a professional voice actress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Live2D animation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4K resolution (3840\u00d72160)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports three languages: Chinese, Japanese, English</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902680?t=1768812209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/2f7ee6b7f204333ae2b06e581f6d69cbf91a5d96/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768812209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/9d32d19c53b7ee292332bf742ab3a5cc1cc8bff2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768812209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902680/9d32d19c53b7ee292332bf742ab3a5cc1cc8bff2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768812209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters depicted are adults.\r\nThis game contains mature themes, including nudity, sexual situations, mild violence, and strong language.\r\nSome scenes may explore elements of power dynamics or adult roleplay.\r\nPlayer discretion is advised \u2014 please enjoy responsibly and in an appropriate setting."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Introduction]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve taken over a tranquil bookstore for a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corner, a girl appears at the same time each day\u2014reading softly, her presence both quiet and captivating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between pages and passing days, you begin